  "Logic"
 ],
 "note": "Standard Widebus 56-pin '16543 pinout, identical in 74act16543 p.1, sn74abt16543 p.1, sn74alvch16543 p.1, sn74lvch16543a p.1, sn74lvt16543 p.1, sn74lvth16543 p.1, sn74lvth16543-ep p.1. Function table (each 8-bit section, A to B shown; B to A uses CEBA/LEBA/OEBA) sn74abt16543 p.2: CEAB high = Z; OEAB high = Z; CEAB low + LEAB high + OEAB low = B holds B0 (latched); CEAB low + LEAB low + OEAB low = B follows A. Description p.1: CEAB must be low both to enter data from A and to output data at B; LEAB low (with CEAB low) = transparent, LEAB rising = store. Model: ce gates both the latch and the output (the destination drives only while CE and OE are both low). Timing A or B -> B or A.",
